  startDelay: 5.7
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: This man behind the keys... I'd barely exchanged a word with for nights
    duration: 6.2
    pauseAfterDuration: 0.6
  - text: And yet, he held the key to the only thing that mattered. My emeralds
    duration: 7
    pauseAfterDuration: 1.2
  - text: How did he know? Maybe it was a trap. Or maybe it was just greed whispering
      in my ear.
    duration: 8.5
    pauseAfterDuration: 1.2
  - text: Either way, I wasn't leaving this island without that bottle.
    duration: 5.7
    pauseAfterDuration: 0
